SUMMARY:Vote Now for Our November Pick!
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi all\,\n\nIn prepping our November Boo
 k Survey winner\, Iain M. Banks’ *Against a Dark Background*\, I found t
 hat reviews are fairly split\, with both sides generally agreeing that the
 re are much better Banks novels to read. I do my research before a book ma
 kes it onto the survey\, but this one got by me. Let’s honor Banks’ se
 cond-place win on our recent contemporary survey and choose a different no
 vel from this prolific sci fi writer.\n\n[Take a moment to vote on which I
 ain M. Banks novel we’ll read in November.](https://forms.gle/9mSFuPV3dQ
 yiHWfm8) The survey closes on Thursday\, September 10th at 5pm EST.\n\nA r
 eminder that Book Club takes a break each October\, so while these novels 
 have fairly large page counts\, we’ll essentially have two months to rea
 d our pick. All of the options below are part of Banks’ Culture series a
 nd\, as we found when we read *The Player of Games*\, each novel offers a 
 window into a much larger universe\, so we don't have to start with the fi
 rst book in the series.\n\nCheers\,\n\nJon
